---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_URL } from '../consts';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Contact', url: `${SITE_URL}/contact/` },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact NSN Explorer"
  description="How to reach NSN Explorer by email about data corrections, supplier profile changes, privacy requests, press and partnerships."
  pageType="ContactPage"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
  <h1>Contact {SITE_NAME}</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    The way to reach us is email. Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <h2>What to write to us about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Data corrections.</strong> A price, part name, date, supplier link or other figure
      that does not match its source record. Send the address of the page and, if you have it, the
      link to the official record that shows the right value.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Supplier profile changes.</strong> If you represent a supplier, send the CAGE code
      and say what to change. We can also hide a supplier's contact details, its website summary,
      or both. See <a href="/privacy/#suppliers">Supplier information</a> in the privacy policy.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Privacy requests.</strong> To see, correct or delete information we hold about you,
      or to opt out of advertising or data sharing where the law gives you that right. See the
      <a href="/privacy/#your-rights">privacy policy</a> for what we keep.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Press and partnerships.</strong> Questions from journalists and researchers, and
      ideas for working together.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <p class="gloss">
    Every figure on {SITE_NAME} comes from a public government record, so we can only correct what
    differs from that record. We cannot change what the government publishes, and we do not take
    part in bids or sell parts to the government.
  </p>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <p class="gloss">
    {SITE_NAME} is operated by NAO Parts LLC. There is no contact form on this site.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
